      <div class="dh-section-head"><span class="dh-section-kicker">Overview</span></div>
            <div class="dh-single-content"><h1>Palai Towers</h1>
<h2>3BHK | 4BHK | Residential Apartment | In Goregaon West | On Sale |</h2>
<p><span style="color: #000000">“ <strong>Palai Tower</strong> ” is a Project developed by one of the Mumbai well-known Developers Palai Group &amp; N D Developers. The Project is perfectly located in Goregaon West  Mumbai. The various configurations in which the flat units are available on sale in this project are <strong>3BHK 961 Carpet 4BHK 1405 Carpet </strong>Residential Apartments And <strong>24 Storey</strong> Residential Apartment With Amenities. <strong>Palai Tower</strong> Mumbai Andheri-Dahisar is a RERA-registered project with registration number <strong>P51800010465</strong>. The Residents Can Enjoy Beautiful Views And Natural</div>
          </section>
    
        
        <section class="dh-template-section dh-template-section--connectivity dh-section-card dh-connectivity-section dh-connectivity-landmark-block" data-dh-template-section="connectivity"><div class="dh-section-head"><span class="dh-section-kicker">Getting Here</span><h2>Location &amp; Nearby Connectivity</h2></div><div class="dh-connectivity-landmark-grid"><div class="dh-connectivity-landmark-card dh-connectivity-landmark-card--metro_station"><span class="dh-connectivity-landmark-card__type">Nearest Metro</span><div class="dh-connectivity-landmark-card__items"><strong>Aarey Metro Station</strong></div></div><div class="dh-connectivity-landmark-card dh-connectivity-landmark-card--railway_station"><span class="dh-connectivity-landmark-card__type">Nearest Railway</span><div class="dh-connectivity-landmark-card__items"><strong>Goregaon Railway Station</strong></div></div><div class="dh-connectivity-landmark-card dh-connectivity-landmark-card--mall"><span class="dh-connectivity-landmark-card__type">Nearby Malls</span><div class="dh-connectivity-landmark-card__items"><strong>Citi Centre Mall Goregaon</strong></div></div><div class="dh-connectivity-landmark-card dh-connectivity-landmark-card--hospital"><span class="dh-connectivity-landmark-card__type">Healthcare Nearby</span><div class="dh-connectivity-landmark-card__items"><strong>Lifeline Medicare Hospital</strong><strong>Kapadia Multispeciality Hospital</strong></div></div><div class="dh-connectivity-landmark-card dh-connectivity-landmark-card--school_college"><span class="dh-connectivity-landmark-card__type">Schools &amp; Colleges</span><div class="dh-connectivity-landmark-card__items"><strong>Vibgyor High Goregaon</strong><strong>Patkar College</strong></div></div></div></section>    
